{"src":"en","tgt":"ro","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ro","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9373.567101,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":10012.642823,"text":"În 1990, a fost adăugat pe lista Siturilor Moștenirii Mondiale în Pericol din cauza amenințării cu nisipurile deșertului."},{"kind":"audio","t":10253.880430000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10255.276888,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10256.716787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10258.268328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10259.931141000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10261.645246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10262.919601,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":18863.859814,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19592.195885999998,"text":"Dacă ați văzut filmul Comoara Națională, s-ar putea să credeți că pe spatele Declarației de Independență a fost scrisă o hartă a unei comori."},{"kind":"audio","t":19749.834967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19751.156682999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19752.809105999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":19754.431629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19756.100982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19757.763956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":19757.889327999997,"samples":3455,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":26840.870926,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27330.721937,"text":"Copiii sunt plasați în plasament familial din motive diverse, care variază de la neglijare până la abuz."},{"kind":"audio","t":27451.733333999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27453.148802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27454.783615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27456.489008999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27457.810534999997,"samples":28309,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"input","t":29883.08698,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30047.039267999997,"text":"și chiar până la șantaj."},{"kind":"audio","t":30081.391305999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":30081.56454,"samples":2619,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40803.618326,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41556.145923000004,"text":"Valea Chocamo, cea mai importantă destinație de escaladă din Chile, cunoscută ca Yosemite-ul Americii de Sud, cu o varietate de pereți mari de granit și faleze."},{"kind":"audio","t":41761.371938000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41762.780636,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41764.48511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":41766.045261,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41767.690814,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41769.338378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41770.958450000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41771.697565,"samples":16662,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":46518.142575000005,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46941.83492,"text":"Au fost acceptate opiniile lui Aristotel în toate chestiunile de știință, inclusiv fiziologia."},{"kind":"audio","t":47058.464368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47060.346486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47061.719684,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47063.353326000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47063.663253,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":54287.744356,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54681.698395,"text":"Dacă nu ești obișnuit să conduci pe drumuri județene, fii atent. Predomină pantele abrupte, pasajele înguste și curbele periculoase."},{"kind":"audio","t":54796.66945,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54798.073628000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54799.773212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":54799.880134,"samples":3120,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":54801.576038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54803.232231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54804.893975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54805.447326,"samples":13708,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":67468.128372,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68228.09658900001,"text":"Prezența echipei invizibile reale, Larson și LaFasto, 1989, pagina 109, este, de asemenea, o componentă unică a unei echipe virtuale."},{"kind":"audio","t":68431.631669,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68433.018407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68434.65912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68436.333584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":68437.928446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68439.564898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68441.215362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68442.835774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68443.065349,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":73009.206656,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73476.75516,"text":"După ce a avut loc accidentul, Gibson a fost transportat la un spital, dar a decedat poco timp ulterior."},{"kind":"audio","t":73591.281166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73592.697325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73594.302767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73595.93146,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73596.747756,"samples":19114,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":82792.899022,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83236.33741200001,"text":"Multe produse de patiserie germane conțin migdale, alune de pădure și alte nuci. Torturile populare se potrivesc adesea foarte bine cu o ceașcă de cafea tare."},{"kind":"audio","t":83375.777428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83377.133405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83378.742408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83380.37926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":83380.479762,"samples":2117,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":83382.176546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83384.035764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83385.424462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83386.422871,"samples":22068,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":90154.533404,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90674.383927,"text":"De needless to say, dacă știi o limbă romanică, îți va fi mai ușor să înveți portugheza."},{"kind":"audio","t":90779.086056,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90780.469024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90782.052965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90783.71260900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90783.867442,"samples":7411,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":97838.259374,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98308.708326,"text":"Spectacolul de sunet și lumină de la piramide este unul dintre cele mai interesante lucruri din zonă pentru copii."},{"kind":"audio","t":98439.046029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98440.417287,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98442.038189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98443.666772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98445.276784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":98445.367926,"samples":2229,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103731.016199,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104181.767136,"text":"Fluxul de trafic este studiul mișcării conducătorilor auto și a vehiculelor individuale între două puncte."},{"kind":"audio","t":104310.952136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104312.354014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104313.932256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104315.573169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104317.199271,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104317.439386,"samples":8916,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":106581.93870700001,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106887.407762,"text":"și a interacțiunilor pe care le au unul cu celălalt."},{"kind":"audio","t":106950.105899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106951.589999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106951.739732,"samples":6910,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":160},{"kind":"input","t":114645.512616,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115129.584281,"text":"Mitchell Gowrie din Australia a terminat pe locul 11 în Super G-ul masculin de coborâre Chet's."},{"kind":"audio","t":115251.449924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":115252.845312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115254.443344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115256.09224700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115257.69795,"samples":32210,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":121635.460259,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122067.289477,"text":"Competitorul Ulrich Joklin a terminat pe locul 16 în Super G-ul masculin de șezut."},{"kind":"audio","t":122177.460986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122178.904415,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122180.599929,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122182.14797,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122182.710951,"samples":14099,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":128627.431023,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":129284.282292,"text":"Așa cum a fost menționat, studii independente sugerează că un batalion de menținere a păcii al ONU din Nepal a adus, fără a ști,"},{"kind":"audio","t":129435.339781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129436.731638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129438.339211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129439.979804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129441.577256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129443.254039,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":129443.37481200001,"samples":5405,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":136517.312838,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136999.398133,"text":"Curând după izbucnirea ostilităților, Marea Britanie a inițiat un blocaj naval al Germaniei."},{"kind":"audio","t":137107.911189,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137109.427169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137110.96959,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137112.636524,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137112.9529,"samples":11034,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":145651.581531,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146012.12949,"text":"De asemenea, a atacat orice lucru care a intrat în apă. Chiar și un dinozaur gigant precum T-Rex nu i-ar fi rival."},{"kind":"audio","t":146108.39815,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146109.750877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146110.870269,"samples":24743,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":146115.208286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146116.646275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146118.265597,"samples":32544,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"input","t":155042.822287,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155416.423598,"text":"Utilizarea înregistrărilor video a condus la descoperiri importante în interpretarea microexpresiilor."},{"kind":"audio","t":155532.955234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155534.375333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155535.979795,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155537.589087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155538.595577,"samples":21622,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":159382.001955,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159656.662502,"text":"mișcări faciale care durează câteva milisecunde."},{"kind":"audio","t":159726.963431,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159728.462161,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159729.08438400002,"samples":16105,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":167451.037283,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167966.355305,"text":"Anunțul a fost făcut după ce Trump a avut o conversație telefonică cu președintele Turciei, Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"audio","t":168101.538185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168102.948663,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168104.587536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168106.221129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168107.831871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168108.05345500002,"samples":8637,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":230},{"kind":"input","t":174923.98877,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175424.112967,"text":"Acestea sunt uneori plaje familiale aglomerate, cu o gamă variată de magazine de-a lungul malului."},{"kind":"audio","t":175546.688214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175548.160914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175549.707665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175551.401179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175552.742916,"samples":28309,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":177076.378923,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177287.533407,"text":"Vreau doar să ajung în siguranță."},{"kind":"audio","t":177336.641481,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177337.196103,"samples":17108,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":188430.047295,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":188976.150824,"text":"Cele mai multe dintre insulele mai mici sunt națiuni independente sau sunt asociate cu Franța și sunt cunoscute ca stațiuni balmare de lux."},{"kind":"audio","t":189134.77678400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189136.190933,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189137.825216,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189139.472699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189141.132162,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189142.76730500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189143.153722,"samples":11535,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"close","t":199703.44446600002,"code":1005}]}